  values.
- #strong[`threshold`]
  (#link("https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/functions.html#float")[`float`])
  -- Threshold value to consider a point as flooded based on depth.

Returns:

- ` xr.DataArray: Interpolated duration values on the grid.` --

